Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.56,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou vingar o Archer.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.54,0:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Apesar de tudo,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.05,0:00:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,ele ainda era o meu parceiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.03,0:00:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.35,0:00:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Já decidi que vou lutar.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.86,0:00:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu não for até o fim com isso, ele nunca me deixaria em paz.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.99,0:00:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Além disso, não podemos simplesmente deixar o Graal intacto.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele precisa ser destruído.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.15,0:00:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu concordo.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.69,0:01:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Um milagre que reúne os desejos de todos, mas aceita apenas um,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.61,0:01:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,nunca deveria ter existido.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.46,0:01:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.82,0:01:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você estaria de acordo com isso, Rin?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.46,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é o sonho mais acalentado da família Tohsaka obter o Graal?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.74,0:01:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, but I don't want some monkey's paw of a weapon.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.63,0:01:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I never really had a wish I wanted granted, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.10,0:01:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And smashing it will be cathartic in its own way.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.45,0:01:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't enter the Holy Grail War for the spoils. Only to win.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.17,0:01:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To hold my head high as a Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.33,0:01:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.55,0:01:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,É a sua cara dizer isso.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.89,0:01:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim é a minha cara?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.33,0:01:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem faz sentido!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.51,0:01:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.86,0:01:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shirou?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.74,0:01:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,O-O que foi?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.07,0:01:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, pensei em fazer algo para comermos.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.23,0:01:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês duas devem estar com fome.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.62,0:02:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A pressa é inimiga da perfeição, não é?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.03,0:02:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos começar enchendo a barriga e avaliando nossas opções.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.25,0:02:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, é verdade.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.73,0:02:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos jantar como de costume.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.17,0:02:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,É assim que sempre fizemos as coisas.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.89,0:02:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que você tem razão.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.36,0:02:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll help out.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.38,0:04:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Holy Grail is at Ryuudou Temple?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.67,0:04:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.42,0:04:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three places in town \Nwhere the Grail can be manifested.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.22,0:04:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My home,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.80,0:04:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kirei's church,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.13,0:04:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and Ryuudou Temple on Mt. Enzou.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.20,0:04:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent familiars to each, and the one at Ryuudou Temple was smashed.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.64,0:04:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe to assume that flashy gold jerk is setting up camp at Ryuudou Temple.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean Issei and the others there are in danger?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.31,0:04:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.03,0:04:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone there was taken away in ambulances?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.32,0:04:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.52,0:04:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This means that any interlopers have been removed ahead of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinji's doing, no doubt.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.13,0:04:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the kind of move I'd expect a wary guy like him to make,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.44,0:04:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but in this case, it's a godsend.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.72,0:04:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuudou Temple, though... That will prove problematic.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.97,0:05:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,With its anti-spirit barrier,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.61,0:05:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Servants can only enter through the main gate.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.09,0:05:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,On the upside, knowing exactly where the Grail will be is good for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.05,0:05:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, our first priority is to stop its summoning.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.35,0:05:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber will take the main gate.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.42,0:05:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll keep him occupied out front,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.29,0:05:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and as she does, we'll climb the mountain from the back and destroy the Grail.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.48,0:05:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.86,0:05:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Saber the only one who can destroy it?{I SEE A FLAW IN YOUR PLAN}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.47,0:05:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.96,0:05:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the Grail's summoned, we won't be able to destroy it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.80,0:05:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can destroy its vessel before then.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.95,0:05:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, we shut down the Grail before it can activate.{i'm sure nothing will go wrong}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.47,0:05:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.12,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by the events up until now,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you would assume the Holy Grail is Illyasviel's heart, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.26,0:05:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think it also needs her body—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,or rather, magic circuits—to function.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.52,0:05:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't want Illyasviel to become the Grail,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.61,0:06:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,so he only removed the core: her heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.53,0:06:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, for it to function,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.14,0:06:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,he needs to implant it into another mage's body.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.19,0:06:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the two of us are here,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.32,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,his choice for the Grail's foundation has to be...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.55,0:06:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinji?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.01,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But he isn't, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.52,0:06:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the Matou mage lineage has died out, \Nthey still have latent magic circuits.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.55,0:06:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Illyasviel's heart would forcibly open even those.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.44,0:06:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that we have to start by locating Shinji.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.80,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I need to distract Archer until you two stop the Grail?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.56,0:06:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.81,0:06:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as we stop the Grail, we'll come running.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.17,0:06:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.96,0:06:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber's no match for him.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.40,0:06:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,On what grounds do you base that assessment, Shirou?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.22,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... As a swordsman, he's no match for you,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.38,0:07:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but no matter how skilled the{a?} warrior, they can't defeat war itself.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.75,0:07:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's that kind of Heroic Spirit.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.68,0:07:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You also have to be war itself, or you'll be swallowed whole.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.83,0:07:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are saying that I would be at a disadvantage against him?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.31,0:07:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we can't send Saber to fight him without a plan, Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.07,0:07:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to figure out his weakness, at least.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.73,0:07:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you said, his Noble Phantasm is war itself,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.01,0:07:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and on top of that, he's a Servant specialized in killing Heroic Spirits.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.08,0:07:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,To beat him, you'd need to have an armory to equal his...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.34,0:07:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.51,0:07:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop mid-sentence?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.12,0:07:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.14,0:07:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he always treated him like a sworn enemy.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.96,0:07:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, a Heroic Spirit without his own Noble Phantasm
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.77,0:07:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't have an original weapon.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll work...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.03,0:08:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This will work!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.52,0:08:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, that would mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have something to say, spit it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.46,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You have an idea, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.36,0:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.26,0:08:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you here, you idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.04,0:08:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the existing plan should be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We carry it out before dawn, got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.48,0:08:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, everyone should go to their rooms and get plenty of rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.19,0:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I need to discuss something with you, Saber.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.83,0:08:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay with this, Saber?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.36,0:08:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I think it the best option.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.33,0:08:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my thanks, Rin.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.20,0:08:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This will allow me to fight without undue concern as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.64,0:09:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.65,0:09:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I catch you in a really bad mood or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.83,0:09:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really. It's not like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.46,0:09:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.03,0:09:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a fever or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.33,0:09:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.58,0:09:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez... Just come in already.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.76,0:09:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you're here for another stupid reason?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.97,0:09:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka, what were you and Saber...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.47,0:09:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.96,0:09:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, forget it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.74,0:09:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hear me out and don't get mad.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.19,0:09:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight him, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.14,0:09:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? So you figured it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.34,0:10:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That the natural enemy of Gilgamesh's Noble Phantasm is Archer's magic.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hang on...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.71,0:10:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You came up with that hare-brained suggestion without even figuring that much out?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.77,0:10:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just had a gut feeling that I'd have the best chance out of the three of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.77,0:10:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, your gut isn't wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.87,0:10:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes Gilgamesh the most powerful is the \Noverwhelming number of Noble Phantasms he has.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.57,0:10:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, for every anti-Heroic-Spirit weapon there is, he has the original.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.95,0:10:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is no Noble Phantasm legendary for killing Archer.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.03,0:10:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of all, given sufficient mana, \Nhe could match anyone weapon for weapon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.32,0:10:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gilgamesh called you two "fakes,"
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.15,0:10:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll bet that was because he actually saw you as threats.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.01,0:10:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Because unlike others, he would have to fight Heroic Spirit Emiya on equal footing.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.25,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a flaw in your plan, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.89,0:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My projections won't be able to keep up with his barrage of Noble Phantasms,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.82,0:10:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and my mana won't last.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.44,0:11:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, if your magic stays at its current level.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.21,0:11:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But you remember Archer's Noble Phantasm, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.50,0:11:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could master that magic—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.95,0:11:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that Reality Marble—you could hold your own against Gilgamesh.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.46,0:11:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.93,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have that kind of mana.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.61,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, several options come to mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.25,0:11:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But the one I'm thinking of...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.97,0:11:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,is a method that links two mages, along with their stores of mana.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.08,0:11:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean creating a path between you and me to share mana?{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.27,0:11:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.08,0:11:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you don't have the mana to use a Reality Marble, I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.60,0:11:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you use my mana to fight Gilgamesh.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, as for how to establish that path...{sexy dolphins time}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.66,0:11:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to transplant my magic crest onto you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.74,0:12:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't that...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.99,0:12:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the magic crest considered a mage's ultimate legacy?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.72,0:12:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.31,0:12:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The current family head takes magic that was originally formless and shapes it over the course of their life.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.08,0:12:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the heritage of a mage family, \Nhanded down from generation to generation.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.57,0:12:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take something that means so much to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.23,0:12:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.50,0:12:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my most important fight,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.68,0:12:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have to commit my most important possession, right?{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.46,0:12:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you staring at me like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.26,0:12:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I was just in awe of you for a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.73,0:12:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's kinda late to say this, \Nbut that's what made me fall for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.38,0:12:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,F-Fall for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.05,0:12:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hardly the time for sweet talk!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you want to keep going, \NI guess I could force myself to listen.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.26,0:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much time.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.32,0:13:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's start the transplant.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.81,0:13:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you need me to do, Tohsaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.91,0:13:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, start by getting undressed...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.09,0:13:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, don't get any funny ideas!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.64,0:13:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I only said to take your clothes off, got it?{lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.67,0:13:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking mine off too, so it's all fair.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.63,0:13:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're undressing too?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.39,0:13:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Like I said, don't get the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.43,0:13:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting undressed is to facilitate the transfer of body heat.{uh huh}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen. To transplant a magic crest,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.93,0:13:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to enter a state of deep rapport.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.87,0:13:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.43,0:13:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, just my top is okay, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.15,0:13:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{O...}{looks kinda awkward in english so let's leave it unsubbed}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.16,0:13:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.76,0:14:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to begin.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.36,0:16:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it work?{lol even the new crest is a cg dolphin}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.26,0:16:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohsaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.64,0:16:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it worked.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.20,0:17:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so flawless there's nothing to critique.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.45,0:17:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So precise there won't be any aftereffects.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.23,0:17:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So perfect that even Kirei, who specialized in this stuff,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.97,0:17:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,would compliment me and say, \N"That was fine work, my disciple."
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.41,0:17:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.72,0:17:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.79,0:17:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the magic crest I transplanted onto you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.49,0:17:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This will give you more than enough mana to create a Reality Marble.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.86,0:17:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So the rest...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.50,0:17:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's up to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.28,0:17:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.77,0:17:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are you so angry?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.70,0:17:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.09,0:17:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, did I do something?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.27,0:17:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it, didn't you? You brute!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.33,0:17:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about, but I'm sure you're wrong!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.00,0:17:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes were closed the whole time,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.84,0:17:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and the only thing I saw were some images that looked like magic circuits...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.21,0:17:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.83,0:17:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There was that weird dream...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.72,0:17:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I was in a schoolyard somewhere,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.33,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,watching some guy doing high jumps like an idiot until the sun set.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.81,0:18:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck was...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.64,0:18:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.17,0:18:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, shut up, shut up, shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.54,0:18:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Shut up, shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.12,0:18:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so rough on the pillows, you idiot!{yeah they've made some great songs}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.15,0:18:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you brute!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.92,0:18:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't peek at other people's secrets and then act all high and mighty!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.95,0:18:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You call that a secret?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.25,0:18:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get a look at {\rDefault-Italic}your{\rDefault} embarrassing memories sooner or later!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.75,0:18:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I do, I won't hold back, you hear?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.57,0:19:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Saber?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A great many things have happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.84,0:19:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wished to etch them into my mind, so that I might never forget them.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.90,0:19:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can, I hope you always remember.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.82,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.55,0:19:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I must give you my thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.20,0:19:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.24,0:19:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It took quite some time,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.87,0:20:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but you have shown me the way.{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.22,0:20:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.42,0:20:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me. This surely makes no sense to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.00,0:20:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wished to put it into words.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.34,0:20:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream has come to an end.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.62,0:20:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I was unable to leave you any example to follow,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.58,0:20:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you have given me an answer that is more than sufficient.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.70,0:20:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean yours?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot say.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.44,0:20:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it is mine, it is the story of an unknown little girl—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.73,0:20:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,one who no longer has anything to do with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.33,0:20:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I once had a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of you as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.57,0:20:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall protect the two of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.94,0:20:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So make certain that you both return to this house.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.14,0:20:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, we'll come back here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.70,0:20:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.98,0:21:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go settle this once and for all, Saber.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.21,0:21:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Vomit forth your curses, Holy Grail.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.01,0:21:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to judge whether the humans of this era
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.97,0:21:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,can withstand the weight of their own wishes.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.78,0:23:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll put an end to your Holy Grail right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.89,0:23:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,With Caster gone, you should not still be here!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.78,0:23:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good enough to fend off his Noble Phantasms.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.67,0:23:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy sham.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:36.71,0:23:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn firsthand the difference \Nbetween counterfeits and the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.59,0:23:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.24,0:14:21.91,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Gib dem wandernden Vogel das Trinkwasser,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.91,0:14:24.18,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,der vom langen Weg kommt.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.18,0:14:26.05,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Benutz den Vogelrahmen
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.20,0:14:31.04,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,in dem der Schlüssel nicht angewendet wird.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.87,0:14:36.90,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Ich spinne den Regenbogen in neuem selbst.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.21,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Heißes Wetter, Regen,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.21,0:14:43.71,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Wind, Schnee, Krieg, Ende, ununterbrochen.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.71,0:14:49.72,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Nimm an, ohne anderer Meinung zu sein, ohne zu fallen.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.72,0:14:52.88,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Es nimmt an, ohne zu fürchten,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.97,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,ohne zu zweifeln.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.60,0:15:02.15,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Sieg im Freund, der auf eine Reise entfernt geht.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.24,0:14:21.91,Ruby,,0,0,0,,Give to the migrating bird water,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.91,0:14:24.18,Ruby,,0,0,0,,who hails from the long path.{the grammar is technically correct german, and it makes sense, but the two clauses are combined in a sort of confusing way. the inflection and basic common sense mean that the "who" is the bird, even though the clause is at the very end of the sentence}{this is not a sentence structure anybody would use, even though its technically correct}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.18,0:14:26.05,Ruby,,0,0,0,,Use the bird frame{(probably incorrectly looked up bird cage)}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.20,0:14:31.04,Ruby,,0,0,0,,for which a key is not used.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.87,0:14:36.90,Ruby,,0,0,0,,I spin the rainbow anew.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.21,Ruby,,0,0,0,,Hot weather, rain,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.21,0:14:43.71,Ruby,,0,0,0,,wind, snow, war, the end, repeat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.71,0:14:49.72,Ruby,,0,0,0,,Accept it without disagreeing, without falling.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.72,0:14:52.88,Ruby,,0,0,0,,It accepts it without fear
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.97,Ruby,,0,0,0,,and without doubt.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.60,0:15:02.15,Ruby,,0,0,0,,Victory to the friend on a long journey.{this line is really broken but using japanese logic im pretty sure its supposed to mean this}
