Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:41.74,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:44.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:49.67,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:52.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:56.17,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:03:01.89,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:08.04,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:12.54,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:15.21,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:17.98,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:26.35,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}If I reach out, I can stay in this night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:31.60,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:35.42,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}The tip of the blade held high
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.92,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}And all the feelings held inside
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:45.37,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur7.5}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.07,0:02:41.74,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.74,0:02:44.96,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.96,0:02:49.67,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur0.75}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.12,0:02:52.96,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.96,0:02:56.17,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.17,0:03:01.89,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.89,0:03:08.04,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur0.75}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.27,0:03:12.54,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.54,0:03:15.21,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur0.75}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.48,0:03:17.98,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur0.75}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.74,0:03:26.35,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur0.75}If I reach out, I can stay in this night
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.35,0:03:31.60,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur0.75}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.75,0:03:35.42,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.75}The tip of the blade held high
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.92,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}And all the feelings held inside
